      "description": "Why did Canada enter World War II, and what led the country to make one of the most important decisions in its history?

In this first episode of **The Canadian Record**, we explore the events leading up to Canada's declaration of war on September 10, 1939. Discover how Britain, Germany, and the growing threat of Nazi expansion shaped Canada's decision, why Canada chose to act independently, and how the war changed the country forever.

From the early days of the conflict to Canada's growing role in the Allied effort, this is the story of how Canada entered World War II.

🇨🇦 **The Canadian Record** — Canadian history. Stories that matter.

